ched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and native SwiftUI. One helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example.","type":"text"}]},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/dialogSuppressionToggle(_:isSuppressed:)-4zjo2":{"title":"dialogSuppressionToggle(_:isSuppressed:)","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/dialogSuppressionToggle(_:isSuppressed:)-4zjo2","abstract":[],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/dialogsuppressiontoggle(_:issuppressed:)-4zjo2","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"dialogSuppressionToggle","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI18LocalizedStringKeyV","text":"LocalizedStringKey","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"isSuppressed","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI7BindingV","text":"Binding","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP","text":"View","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Interaction_DragView","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"Interaction_DragView","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Drags a layer in any direction with momentum and rubber-band bounds. The draggable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"card responds to touch input via Origami’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origami.Drag"},{"type":"text","text":" patch, which wires its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"output "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Position"},{"type":"text","text":" to the layer’s transform. The rendered view uses the same"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"centered 220×140 tan card, 888×1212 artboard, and full-bleed framing as the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"GitHub macOS runner evidence bound to this head."}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Interaction_DragView","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview","kind":"symbol"}}}